{"output":"I’ll inspect the search flow and tests, add a focused fix for stale requests, and run the existing tests without changing them or installing dependencies.\n\nThe controller lets every completed request update state. I added a request ID check before results, errors, and loading updates. Clearing the query also invalidates pending requests. The existing tests lack overlapping-request cases, so I’ll check those with an inline probe without modifying test files.\n\nFixed src/search/controller.ts with request IDs so only the latest search updates state. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API unchanged.\n\nVerification passed, exit 0: npm test, all 4 tests; node --input-type=module inline probe, 8 race scenarios; git diff --check.\n\nNo tests modified or dependencies installed.","final_output":"Fixed src/search/controller.ts with request IDs so only the latest search updates state. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API unchanged.\n\nVerification passed, exit 0: npm test, all 4 tests; node --input-type=module inline probe, 8 race scenarios; git diff --check.\n\nNo tests modified or dependencies installed.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":5,"tool_calls":[{"name":"skill","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"git status --short; git ls-files '*AGENTS.md' 'AGENTS.md'","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-apul1kbx/search-2-optimized/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":202,"stdout_bytes":0,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-1adeec339a6ca21e8f8df92847b4dee7.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"npm test && node --input-type=module <<'NODE'\nimport assert from 'node:assert/strict';\nimport { createSearchController } from './src/search/controller.ts';\nconst items = [{ id: 'new', title: 'Latest', url: '/latest' }];\nlet cases = 0;\nfor (const clear of [false, true]) {\n  for (const reject of [false, true]) {\n    for (const oldFirst of [false, true]) {\n      const pending = [];\n      const c = createSearchController({ search: () => new Promise((resolve, reject) => pending.push({ resolve, reject })) });\n      const old = c.search('same');\n      const latest = c.search('same');\n      if (clear) {\n        const clearing = c.search('  ');\n        assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), { query: '', results: [], loading: false, error: null });\n        await clearing;\n      }\n      const finishOld = async () => {\n        const before = c.getState();\n        if (reject) pending[0].reject(new Error('Stale error'));\n        else pending[0].resolve([{ id: 'old', title: 'Old', url: '/old' }]);\n        await old;\n        assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), before);\n      };\n      if (oldFirst) await finishOld();\n      pending[1].resolve(items);\n      await latest;\n      if (!oldFirst) await finishOld();\n      assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), clear\n        ? { query: '', results: [], loading: false, error: null }\n        : { query: 'same', results: items, loading: false, error: null });\n      cases++;\n    }\n  }\n}\nconsole.log(`Passed ${cases} overlapping-request and clear-query scenarios`);\nNODE\nresult=$?\ngit diff --check && git diff -- src/search/controller.ts\nexit $result","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-apul1kbx/search-2-optimized/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":371,"stdout_bytes":2176,"stderr_bytes":0,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-7511b131a322157983e330ee9bdd97a1.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}}],"usage":{"input_tokens":37090,"output_tokens":1027},"usage_details":{"cached_input_tokens":7296,"cache_write_tokens":0,"reasoning_tokens":9}}
